{"id":"vod_jy_32585","vodId":"32585","provider":"jy","providerName":"金鹰资源","type":2,"name":"全职猎人2011","name_cn":"全职猎人2011","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第148集","images":{"common":"https://image.jinyingimage.com/cover/4572837cfa3489c4ef6c180ff21eb8ca.jpg"},"summary":"小杰富力士（潘惠美暂无内容配音）自幼失去双亲，由婶婶抚养长大，自由的大海和幽深的森林培养了他得天独厚的敏锐和豁达。长大后的小杰偶然得知，自己的父亲并没有死亡，并且留给了他一个任务，这个任务就是：成为“猎人”，然后找到他。“猎人”，那个时代最风光的职业，经过层层挑战千挑万选，只有最最优秀的人才能够获得猎人执照，而有了这张执照，便可以在这个凶险的世界里更自如的生存下去。为了追随父亲的脚步，小杰上路了。这一路暗礁重重，但是小杰凭借自己的本能结识了优秀的朋友，志愿成为医生的雷欧力（藤原启治暂无内容配音），最后一个窟卢塔族酷拉皮卡（泽城美雪暂无内容配音），还有他这辈子最重要的同伴奇犽（伊濑茉莉也暂无内容配音）。此外，那宿命中的敌人们也出现了——幻影旅团。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2022-10-17 13:26:26","playable":true,"episodeCount":147,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"jinyingm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第001集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/negJkWDd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第002集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/vbmZEWnd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第003集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/zbqx2Wka/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第004集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/negJkWjd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第005集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/vbmZEW3d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第006集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/zbqx2Wya/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第007集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/7axklWPe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第008集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/6dBBnMod/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第009集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/QdJ6Pnyd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第010集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/0dNk8r8e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第011集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/PdR6Lywd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第012集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/QbYEMJYb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第013集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/Le319qpb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第014集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/xe73AxBe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第015集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/negJkqjd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第016集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/vbmZEz3d/in